Runs of typed4pt.py (floating point; a value below 0 after the correction would exclude the code).
Each block: the command, then the lines the run printed (solver warnings removed).
Val is the optimum on the samples; corrected adds the largest violation found between the samples
times the number of pairs, triples or quadruples of each kind; viol lists those violations.
kiss d d4 rounds n t: n directions with inner products at most t, three-point degree d,
four-point degree d4 (-1: none); hole d d4 rounds nF dA dF: 24 directions within dA and nF within dF.

